QtreGB visual assets

This file covers the visual assets in the `assets/` directory (the "Assets").
The program code is covered by `LICENSE.txt` (GPL-3.0-or-later), not by this
file.

Copyright dedication
--------------------
Unless noted otherwise below, the QtreGB project dedicates the Assets to the
public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain
Dedication:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

To the extent possible under law, the project has waived all copyright and
related or neighboring rights to those Assets.

This dedication currently covers the application icon and logo:

- `assets/QtreGB_icon_generic_256.png`.

Exception: `assets/screenshot_01.png` is a documentation capture that includes
game imagery from a third-party Game Boy game. That imagery is not dedicated to
CC0 and remains with its respective author. The screenshot is included only to
document QtreGB.

Provenance of the application icon
----------------------------------
The application icon was created for the QtreGB project in 2026. To the best of
the project's knowledge, it does not incorporate any third-party source image.

